    {
        "content": "<p><span class=\"user-mention silent\" data-user-id=\"873350\">Weiyi Wang</span> <a href=\"#narrow/channel/113489-new-members/topic/Formalisation.20of.20a.20trivial.20inequality/near/625625003\">said</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><span aria-label=\"stuck out tongue wink\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f61c\" role=\"img\" title=\"stuck out tongue wink\">:stuck_out_tongue_wink:</span> What if <code>(p q : ℤ)</code></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Then what is <code>p / q</code>?</p>",
