    {
        "content": "<p><span class=\"user-mention silent\" data-user-id=\"873350\">Weiyi Wang</span> <a href=\"#narrow/channel/113489-new-members/topic/Formalisation.20of.20a.20trivial.20inequality/near/625624196\">said</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Hi, are you in a specific environment (e.g. a game setup where only limited theorems are allowed to use), or anything in the latest lean / mathlib can be used?</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>nope</p>",
